    "confidence": "high",
    "rationale": "Although the theft occurred during the trip and the police report, receipt, and submission timing requirements are evidenced, the policy requires theft claims to be declined if the item was not attended at the time of theft. The evidence states the laptop was in the hotel room safe while the insured was out, which meets the policy definition of unattended. The claim is therefore denied under the unattended-items exclusion."
